# VidFlow Ideation Studio & Content Library Implementation

## Overview

Build an Ideation Studio where users brainstorm video content (hooks, titles, descriptions) before running the pipeline. Content is saved to a Content Library and pulled by the Script Node at runtime.

**Pattern:** Same as Thumbnails
- Ideation Studio = Thumbnail Studio (creation/brainstorming)
- Content Library = Elements Library (storage/management)
- Script Node = Thumbnail Node (pulls from library)

**Key Features:**
1. Ideation Studio — Wizard flow for brainstorming hooks, titles, descriptions
2. Content Library — Save, tag, and organize text content
3. @Mention in Script Node — Reference saved content
4. Script Node Integration — Use saved content or generate fresh

