## Part 2: API Routes

### GET /api/content

List user's content with filtering.

**Query params:**
- `type` — Filter by type (hook, title, description, intro, cta, outline, script)
- `tags` — Filter by tags (comma-separated)
- `search` — Search name, content, and topic
- `topic` — Filter by topic
- `limit` — Results per page (default 20)
- `offset` — Pagination offset

**Response:**
```json
{
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "name": "n8n Hook - Automation",
      "type": "hook",
      "content": "Everyone's using n8n wrong. Here's the one thing...",
      "tags": ["@n8n", "@automation"],
      "topic": "n8n beginner tutorial",
      "createdAt": "2026-01-06T..."
    }
  ],
  "total": 45,
  "hasMore": true
}
```

### POST /api/content

Create new content item.

**Body:**
```json
{
  "name": "n8n Hook - Automation",
  "type": "hook",
  "content": "Everyone's using n8n wrong. Here's the one thing...",
  "tags": ["@n8n", "@automation"],
  "topic": "n8n beginner tutorial",
  "archetype": "tutorial",
  "metadata": {
    "generated": true,
    "model": "claude-sonnet-4"
  }
}
```

### POST /api/content/bulk

Create multiple content items at once (for saving multiple hooks/titles).

**Body:**
```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Hook Option 1",
      "type": "hook",
      "content": "...",
      "tags": ["@n8n"],
      "topic": "n8n tutorial"
    },
    {
      "name": "Hook Option 2",
      "type": "hook",
      "content": "...",
      "tags": ["@n8n"],
      "topic": "n8n tutorial"
    }
  ]
}
```

### GET /api/content/[id]

Get single content item.

### PUT /api/content/[id]

Update content item.

**Body:**
```json
{
  "name": "Updated name",
  "content": "Updated content...",
  "tags": ["@n8n", "@updated"]
}
```

### DELETE /api/content/[id]

Delete content item.

### POST /api/content/resolve

Resolve @tags to content for pipeline use.

**Body:**
```json
{
  "tags": ["@n8n-hook", "@main-cta"],
  "type": "hook"  // Optional: filter by type
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "resolved": [
    { "tag": "@n8n-hook", "id": "uuid", "content": "Everyone's using...", "type": "hook" },
    { "tag": "@main-cta", "id": "uuid", "content": "Subscribe and hit...", "type": "cta" }
  ],
  "missing": []
}
```

### GET /api/content/tags

List all unique tags user has used.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "tags": ["@n8n", "@automation", "@tutorial", "@main-cta"]
}
```

### POST /api/ideation/generate

Generate content options using AI.

**Body:**
```json
{
  "type": "hook",
  "topic": "A comprehensive beginner tutorial on getting started with n8n",
  "count": 5,
  "style": ["question", "bold_claim", "story"],
  "archetype": "tutorial",
  "channelBible": { ... }  // Optional: include for tone matching
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "options": [
    {
      "content": "Everyone's talking about automation, but n8n is the one tool that actually delivers...",
      "style": "bold_claim"
    },
    {
      "content": "What if I told you that you could automate your entire workflow for free?",
      "style": "question"
    }
  ]
}
```

