## Part 9: Warnings

### Don't Do These Things

❌ **Don't make wizard steps required** — User can skip to any step or exit anytime

❌ **Don't auto-advance wizard** — User controls when to move forward

❌ **Don't lose wizard state on refresh** — Persist to localStorage or URL params

❌ **Don't duplicate content on bulk save** — Check for duplicates by content hash

❌ **Don't generate without topic** — Topic is required for all generation

❌ **Don't forget channel bible** — Use it for tone matching in generation

### Watch Out For

⚠️ **Long generation times** — Show loading states, allow cancellation

⚠️ **AI rate limits** — Don't spam generate button, debounce

⚠️ **Large content** — Descriptions can be long, handle in UI gracefully

⚠️ **Duplicate tags** — Normalize and dedupe

⚠️ **Missing content at runtime** — Handle gracefully if saved content deleted

